378	 *    run's events share one run_id and run-scoped reads were never masked by
379	 *    `superseded_by IS NULL`.
380	 *  - `event` — a point in the log (a specific card). Read-side chain resolution
381	 *    (get_content) resolves a superseded id to its full lineage, so a frozen
382	 *    event permalink still lands even after it's superseded.
383	 *  - `feed`  — a channel / conversational stream (all activity in #leads).
384	 *  - `behavior_run` — one execution scoped to its Behavior drill-down. Requires
385	 *    both route identifiers: the owning agent and the Behavior.
